message: "If you use or refer to this analysis, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Who misses NHS outpatient appointments? An auditable analysis of NHS England's Hospital Outpatient Activity 2025-26"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible analysis of 150.3 million NHS outpatient appointments and GP appointment data,
  computed from official NHS England files with SHA-256 provenance, reconciliation to published
  totals, and an overdispersion-adjusted comparison of NHS trusts.
